# UnicAtor — Frank Heitmeyer

*Sovereign by Design. We translate conviction into infrastructure.*

Building **soli.coop**: a federation of independent national member associations with real membership
rights — transparent admission, the right to be heard, due process before any exclusion, and exit with all
your data. Governance runs through **12+1 Round Tables** (twelve members, one non-voting AI facilitator —
the AI never governs), scaling from the table up. The full stack — agents, governance, member platform —
goes open source (AGPL-3.0) here when the founding gates pass.

**The mission:** https://decentralize.club
**The platform:** https://soli.coop
**The builder:** https://unicate.ai — a Delaware public benefit corporation bound to four chartered public benefits

Go to public, not to market.
